# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Copied verbatim into dist/ by `expo export -p web`.
#
# The web build is the admin platform only, so the root path is sent straight to
# /admin at the edge — the client-side gate would otherwise have to do it after
# the bundle loads.
/    /admin    302

# Real files in dist/ (JS bundles, icons, manifest.json) are served first;
# anything else falls through to the single-page entry document.
# Cloudflare Access endpoints under /cdn-cgi/ are handled at the edge and never
# reach Pages routing, so this catch-all does not shadow them.
/*    /index.html    200
